<p id="S3.Thmtheorem7.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.Thmtheorem7.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">By applying the independence polynomial formula for <math id="S3.Thmtheorem7.p1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G[H]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G[H]</annotation></semantics></math> as presented
in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">4</a>]</cite>, we obtain:</span></p>
